{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1410724001:1":{"text":"なぜ竜が……ここは、陛下の寝殿だぞ！","source_cn":"这里怎么会有一头龙……这里可是女王的寝殿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3554DD7BBCAC4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1410724001":{"text":"なぜ竜が……ここは、陛下の寝殿だぞ！","source_cn":"这里怎么会有一头龙……这里可是女王的寝殿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3554DD7BBCAC4B56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410724002:1":{"text":"陛下ってまさか……","source_cn":"哪个女王？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE24B56516CCCC80E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410724003:1":{"text":"サロクディアの女王、ナザレス様に決まっているだろう！","source_cn":"当然是萨洛克兰的女王——奈萨雷斯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B550E358DB5A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410724004:1":{"text":"あ、アンタらの女王様は、自分の寝殿に竜を飼ってるのか……？","source_cn":"你们的女王，在寝殿里，养了，一头……龙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF26B965657A9D52F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410724005:1":{"text":"なんとまあ、動物愛護精神の強いお方だこと……","source_cn":"哇哦，她真是爱惜濒危物种呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6D2FC00D51FB12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410724006:1":{"text":"冗談を言っている場合ではない！","source_cn":"我没心情和你开玩笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64ABB6779D1F57DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410724007:1":{"text":"陛下の寝殿は、言うなればこの国の聖域……ここを訪れた者は、数えるほどしかいない。","source_cn":"你要知道女王的寝殿尊贵无比，到访过此处的人屈指可数！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5627AF2B3CE691D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410724008:1":{"text":"まあ、竜を飼ってるなんて、そうそう言えないもんな。","source_cn":"养龙这种爱好的确不能被你们知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37FC17149A159C5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410724009:1":{"text":"……問題はそこではない！","source_cn":"……重点不是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F814B19AF24AA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410724010:1":{"text":"寝殿の外には守衛や従者がいるが、今思えば、長老たちと一部の貴族以外、陛下の素顔を目にした者はいない……","source_cn":"尽管外围有守卫和侍从，但仔细想来，除了那几位长老和部分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FA8918004FC8D4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410724011:1":{"text":"陛下は我々に生命力を与えるため、常に体調が芳しくなく、静養が必要だと聞かされてきた……","source_cn":"我们得到的说辞是，女王陛下为了赐予我们生命力，身体一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFEC979359658E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410724012:1":{"text":"もし、本当は……人前に出たくないからではなく、出られないのだとしたら……？","source_cn":"如果……女王并非不想见人，而是不能见人呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C427B985116F0D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410724013:1":{"text":"インドラ、アンタ……もしかして……","source_cn":"等等……我好像懂了！因度厄，你是说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2148FCEEDE7CF452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410724014:1":{"text":"ああ、地におわすヘクト様！我らが父なるヘクト様！まさか、嘘だろ……！","source_cn":"赫托的胡子！赫托的铁锤！赫托，总之赫托在下！你是说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5A2F6459E43433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410724015:0":{"text":"<shk>あの竜</shk>が、アンタらの女王様だってのか！？","source_cn":"你们的女王，<shk>是那头龙？！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD87DE4D9502021","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410724016:0":{"text":"だが、女王が竜であるはずが……もしや、我々が飲んでいたあれは――","source_cn":"但女王怎么会是龙……？我们喝的龙蛋，难道是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4EA3FDFB2C5BE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410724017:3":{"text":"だから、警告したでしょう……","source_cn":"我不是早就警告过你了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4356CEF39DA6939","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410724018:0":{"text":"なっ！？なんでアンタがここに！？","source_cn":"怎么是你？你从哪里冒出来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36A0BF3E37E598FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410724019:1":{"text":"それはこちらのセリフです。","source_cn":"是你们不该出现在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BB61DF48E86AFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410724020:2":{"text":"陛下の寝殿に許可なく立ち入るなど……","source_cn":"此为女王寝殿，不得擅自闯入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1E119F078A2BF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410724021:1":{"text":"エイン様、タドール将軍、あなた方はこのことを知っていて、ずっと隠していたのか？","source_cn":"奎茵冕下，都铎将军，你们早就知道这一切，却选择了隐瞒吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B7848FDDE25711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410724022:0":{"text":"陛下の御意志に異を唱える資格など我々にはありません。私たちは陛下を信じることを選んだだけです。これまでのあなたのようにね。","source_cn":"因度厄，艾塞勒的任何生灵都无权评判女王。我们只是选择了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2160200006F82986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410724023:0":{"text":"ふんっ！フェリルを殺した犯人が。またわけの分からないことを言って惑わそうとしてるな！","source_cn":"好啊！杀害斐利尔的凶手，又开始说这些蛊惑人心的疯话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE702E42610397359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410724024:2":{"text":"道を正す価値もない愚か者ども……タドール、陛下に害をなす者たちを排除しなさい。","source_cn":"愚昧之人已经丧失了被引入正途的价值。都铎，是时候将威胁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE3199D41677EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:38:14010724:0":{"text":"会話の途中、部下を引き連れてきたエインとタドールが行く手を阻んだ。","source_cn":"你们交谈之际，奎茵和都铎带来了人马挡住了你们的去路。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xACF64CDD9CDE38F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"会話の途中、部下を引き連れてきたエインとタドールが行く手を阻んだ。","female":"会話の途中、部下を引き連れてきたエインとタドールが行く手を阻んだ。","variant_male_record_index":"166565","variant_female_record_index":"166566","do